<title>USA: SmithKline says Canada clears heart drug.</title>
<headline>SmithKline says Canada clears heart drug.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Health Protection Branch cleared carvedilol for treating congestive heart failure, SmithKline Beecham Plc and Boehringer Mannheim said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The drug has recently been cleared for the heart failure use in countries including Denmark, Spain, Sweden, and Norway.</p>
